    "id": "ncert.maths.ch01.p008.rational_irrational_operations",
    "text": "The sum or difference of a rational number and an irrational number is irrational. The product of a non-zero rational number and an irrational number is irrational. The quotient is also irrational whether the irrational number is divided by the non-zero rational, or the non-zero rational is divided by the irrational number.",
